###  https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#Control
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#Control> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                            rdfs:subClassOf <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Control> ;
