###  https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#CorrectiveControl
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#CorrectiveControl> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#ReactiveControl> ;
