                                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Corrective control"@en .


###  https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#CurrentRisk
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#CurrentRisk> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                rdfs:subClassOf <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#Control> ;
                                                                                <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2024-05-15"^^xsd:date ;
