###  https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#FirstLineOfDefence
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#FirstLineOfDefence> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                       rdfs:subClassOf <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#Control> ;
