                                                                                       rdfs:comment "the way risks are managed and controlled day-to-day. Assurance comes directly from those responsible for delivering specific objectives or processes. Its value comes from those who know the business, culture and day-to-day challenges."@en ;
                                                                                       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#> ;
                                                                                       rdfs:label "First line of defence"@en ;
