###  https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#InitialRisk
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#InitialRisk> rdf:type owl:Class ;
