###  https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#PreventativeControl
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#PreventativeControl> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#ProactiveControl> ;
